<title>UK: CRICKET-NOTTINGHAMSHIRE V AUSTRALIA MATCH DRAWN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NOTTINGHAMSHIRE V AUSTRALIA MATCH DRAWN.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The three-day</p>
<p>cricket match between Nottinghamshire and Australia ended in a</p>
<p>draw on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Nottinghamshire 239. Australia 398-5.</p>
